   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide legal advice, capacity building, advocacy and file litigation for people living with HIV/AIDS (PLWHA) and those affected by the epidemic and thereby create an enabling environment and increase awareness of target groups to seek legal services. The main target groups are PLWHA and vulnerable populations such as women, men having sex with men, sex workers and injecting drug users.</narrative>
